From b7030ce67e4e55adc2543b2652b593dbd0713f99 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: logdog2325 <loganjayfisher@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 16:32:21 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] XD Netplay: fix the Android abort at team preview,
 keyboard-bound GBA defaults on every slot, desktop Share Log button (v1.5.13)

- ControlGroupContainer::SetInputOverrideFunction/ClearInputOverrideFunction
  ran unlocked while GetInput() read the std::function under
  s_get_state_mutex on the CPU thread; libc++'s move-assign nulls the
  target before cloning, so a poll in that window called an empty function
  and aborted (bad_function_call at team preview on the Thor, symbolized
  from the shipped library). Writers now take the same lock. Android's
  GbaInputFocusManager registered the GameCube override on every touch
  event; it now registers once per port and only flips the atomic enable.
- Launcher 'Use defaults' binds the GBA mapping to the platform keyboard
  device on all four GBA slots (Dolphin's default device is the first by
  sort priority, i.e. a gamepad when one is attached, where the key names
  do not exist); the checklist verifies slots 0 and 1 and that the device
  exists. The joiner's GBA is slot 0 ('GBA 1'), the host's is slot 1.
- Share Log... in the launcher footer: newest gba_detect log, save-as
  (Desktop by default), then opens the folder.
